  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASHOKA I eDoctar Telemedecine Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accessing healthcare facilities is a huge challenge in Africa. eDoctar is a telemedicine platform offering a video/text-based online remote medical consultations services across operating across rural .eDoctar uses a web and mobile app that enables integration for a wide variety of medical devices in partnership with local health centers and clinics. The goal is to create telemedicine centers to connect patients to doctors remotely.</narrative>
  </description>
